    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MASTER AUTOPOSTING ENGINE (ENTERPRISE ARCHITECTURE)\n\n### CHANNELS SUPPORTED:\n- **YouTube** (Long-form & Shorts via native resumable upload)\n- **Instagram** (Feed & Reels via Meta Graph API container + publish)\n- **Facebook** (Page Feed, Photos & Videos)\n- **LinkedIn** (B2B Shares & Posts)\n- **TikTok** (Content Posting API - Inbox / Direct Upload)\n- **Pinterest** (Pins with public asset links)\n\n### CRUCIAL SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. **Google Sheets**: Connect your Google Sheets account to nodes reading `ContentQueue` and writing to `PostLog`.\n2. **Google Drive**: Connect Google Drive account to host media publicly for Instagram & Pinterest.\n3. **Meta / Instagram / Facebook**: Provide `YOUR_META_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `YOUR_FB_PAGE_ID`, and `YOUR_IG_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID`.\n4. **LinkedIn**: Attach your LinkedIn OAuth2 credential.\n5. **YouTube**: Attach Google OAuth2 with YouTube Upload scopes.\n6. **TikTok**: Attach TikTok Developer Bearer Token.\n8. **Zero Fail Isolation**: Every platform branch has `continueOnFail: true`. If one channel fails or API is missing, all others complete unaffected!",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "Sticky: Enterprise Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
